// Messages and tables nest in place at most 64 deep, one within another, and
// structs too, the outermost included. Each chain here is one too deep, and
// the error points at the definition that grows too deep, rather than at
// those that hold it. A struct within a table adds nothing to the table's
// depth, and vectors nest tables deeper.

